      ['S', '32–35 in', '81–89 cm'],
      ['M', '35–38 in', '89–97 cm'],
      ['L', '38–41 in', '97–104 cm']
    ]}
    pick={1}
  />
  <p class="m-text">S is the match: she wears S in running tops, which fits a 32–35 in chest.</p>
  <p class="m-meta">Measure around the fullest part of the chest, under the arms.
Side straps adjust about 2 in either way, so in-between sizes can go down.</p>
  {#snippet actions()}
    <Action
      label="Fit between sizes"
      icon={ListBullets}
      onclick={() => ask('How the Tarnwick Ridge 8L vest fits between sizes S and M, strap adjustment and bounce', 'Fit between sizes')}
    />
  {/snippet}
</Section>
